Blinkered word list for Kiswahili (sw)
SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later

This file is generated. It is not a copy of any dictionary. It is the list of words that
appear in a frequency-ordered corpus of sw AND are accepted by every validator
below, filtered to what the game can deal as tiles. Neither input is redistributed here.
Rebuild it with `pnpm dictionary build --language=sw`.

Distributed under LGPL-2.1-or-later, which is the most restrictive of the terms below. See
PROVENANCE.md for what was relied on and why.

Ordering
  sw.wikipedia.org contributors, word counts over the article text of the pages-articles dump
  CC-BY-SA-4.0

Validation
  hunspell `sw_TZ` (LGPL-2.1-or-later) — Jambo Swahili Spellchecker, Alberto Escudero-Pascual and contributors; word lists from Egerton University, the TUKI English-Swahili Dictionary, the Kamusi Project and Crúbadán

The full text of each license is in ../licenses/.
